        <mxCell id="n1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;fontStyle=2;fontSize=10;align=left;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;" value="Whatever language someone writes in, it all becomes the same clear English summary before anyone reads it — so no DMC&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;officer has to read three languages under pressure. Steps 2, 6 and 7 only run when they are actually needed.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
